{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/you/ai-projects/video-generator-ai/courses/agent-skills-for-testers/lessons/10-skills-that-hand-off/material/copy-direct/.claude/skills/test-nightjar\n\n# Route a testing request\n\nThis skill doesn't test anything. It picks the skill that should, says which one and\nwhy in one sentence, and starts it.\n\n| They want to know | Skill |\n|---|---|\n| Whether a flow on the page works, step by step | browser-check |\n| Whether something reported broken really is, and why | triage-bug |\n| Whether a known defect is fixed now | verify-fix |\n| What to test for a story | write-test-cases |\n| How to get a bug into the tracker | tell them to run `/file-bug` (you can't start it) |\n\nAsk a question only when the answer would change which skill runs. If the request\nalready says enough, start.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc6de75d-385d-471e-b7f3-868c2f7ed61f","uuid":"08a10ef2-5d5b-4434-b1b8-d6b16acb0497","timestamp":"2026-11-21T22:38:08.761Z","isSynthetic":true}
