{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChGshifpMts9nK6fRp9am","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can check NightJar in a few ways. Which one do you want?\n\n1. **Walk a flow in the browser**: log a night, import a CSV, the sleep diary or the nudge banner. I take a screenshot at every step. (browser-check)\n2. **Confirm a suspected bug**: tell me what looks broken. I'll reproduce it and write a bug bundle and a ledger row. (triage-bug)\n3. **Recheck known defects**: rerun the repro scripts for the open bugs and update the ledger. (verify-fix)\n4. **Plan tests for a story**: for example S-114, the bedtime nudge. I'll write test cases for review. (write-test-cases)\n\nTo get a bug into the tracker, run `/file-bug` yourself. I can't start that one.\n\nTell me the number, or describe what's bothering you, and I'll start."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":394,"cache_read_input_tokens":23005,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":394},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc6de75d-385d-471e-b7f3-868c2f7ed61f","uuid":"cf80d051-32cb-4314-9416-8bb9b27ab155","timestamp":"2026-11-21T22:38:11.766Z","request_id":"req_011ChGshiWPmhVtCpt6Rbbwb"}
